{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From the creator of <strong>Who's Lila?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Last Look along Woodward Boulevard is a horror puzzle adventure, where your <strong>thoughts and mood</strong> affect the environment around you. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144810/extras/thoughtcontrol.gif?t=1729357291\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through strangest planes, constantly struggling to keep your own mind in check, solve puzzles <strong>by using your mood</strong> and avoid the many dangers awaiting you along the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who deterred you from your path? Who is the mysterious person guiding you? Why does this all seem so familiar...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144810/extras/library.gif?t=1729357291\" />Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Thought/Mood system - hard to control at first; As you move through the journey, you will gain access to more and more tools to wrangle your thoughts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Gritty dithered style, now in multicolor! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> More focus on puzzles and mechanics tied to mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Live action cutscenes with some familiar faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Surreal and diverse locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144810/extras/circlepuzzle.gif?t=1729357291\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2144810?t=1729357291","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2144810?t=1729357291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor